    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated on the outskirts of Skibbereen town in West Cork, this three bed detached property with outbuildings, set on 0.5 acre approximately offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a renovation project in a convenient and well-established location.\n\nThe property extends to 100 sq. m. (1,074 sq. ft.) approx., and provides well-proportioned accommodation over two floors. The ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, sitting room, living room, kitchen and guest WC, while upstairs there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom. There is also a separate utility room.\n\nTo the rear, there are numerous outbuildings including a garage and shed. \n\nThe property now requires renovation and refurbishment throughout, offering considerable scope for the successful purchaser to modernise and upgrade the accommodation to their own requirements. Given its vacant condition and the nature of the works required, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and potentially the Derelict Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant eligibility criteria and approval by the local authority.\n\nThe location is a particular feature of the property, being positioned on the outskirts of Skibbereen, while remaining within easy reach of the town's range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, services and amenities. The surrounding area also provides convenient access to West Cork's coastline and many of the region's popular villages and attractions.\n\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial site with a three-bedroom house and the potential to create a comfortable home in a highly desirable West Cork location.\n\nDisclaimer\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, all information is provided in good faith and is believed to be correct, but is not guaranteed. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy and completeness of all details by independent inspection or enquiry. No representation or warranty is made regarding the condition, measurements, boundaries, planning status, services or other information relating to the property. All measurements, maps, photographs and distances are approximate and for guidance purposes only. Photographs, video and drone imagery are provided for illustrative purposes and may include features, furnishings or items not included in the sale."
      },
